    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "\n\n\n<p>You have managed to develop a malleability that allows you to change the size of your transformations. When you shift shape, you can take on small or large <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">forms. You are subject to the restrictions, but do not gain any bonuses from the new form (such as the ability to wield larger weapons).</span></p>\n"
